        "officialTitle" : "A Phase 2b, Randomized, Double-Blind, Parallel-Group, Placebo-Controlled Study to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Rezpegaldesleukin in the Treatment of Adult Patients With Moderate-to-Severe Atopic Dermatitis (REZOLVE-AD)",
